roles: runner
expect: ^RUNNER OK
forge: runners

# The forge decides this one. A runner host's own answer about its runners is what it
# BELIEVES; the merge group is served by what the forge SEES, and on 2026-09-16 the two
# disagreed for forty minutes. The verdict is computed in Go from the runner list and this
# body is never run on a machine; it is here so the class reads like every other workload.
echo "RUNNER OK is decided by the forge: every runner named <machine>-nova-* is online"
